1. Initialize Providers & Plugins

terraform init

2. Validate Configuration

terraform fmt
terraform validate

3. Review Plan & Apply

terraform plan
terraform apply -auto-approve

4. Verify Web Ingress & SSH Access

# Query web endpoint
curl http://<EC2_PUBLIC_IP>

# SSH into the server using generated private key
ssh -i ec2-key.pem ubuntu@<EC2_PUBLIC_IP>